
@lisp
(define 
  (horner-eval x coefficient-sequence)
  (accumulate 
   (lambda (this-coeff higher-terms)
     ⟨??⟩)
   0
   coefficient-sequence))
@end lisp

For example, to compute @math{{1 + 3x} + {5x^3 + x^5}} at @math{{x = 2}} you
would evaluate

@lisp
(horner-eval 2 (list 1 3 0 5 0 1))
@end lisp
@end quotation

